{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 14,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every wise woman buildeth her house: but the foolish plucketh it down with her hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that walketh in his uprightness feareth the LORD: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perverse in his ways despiseth him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the mouth of the foolish ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a rod of pride: but the lips of the wise shall preserve them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where no oxen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the crib ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clean: but much increase ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the strength of the ox.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A faithful witness will not lie: but a false witness will utter lies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A scorner seeketh wisdom, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "findeth it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not: but knowledge ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " easy to him that understandeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Go from the presence of a foolish man, when thou perceivest not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the lips of knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wisdom of the prudent ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to understand his way: but the folly of fools ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fools make a mock at sin: but among the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " favor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The heart knoweth its own bitterness; and a stranger doth not intermeddle with its joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The house of the wicked shall be overthrown: but the tabernacle of the upright shall flourish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is a way which seemeth right to a man, but the end of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ways of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful; and the end of that mirth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heaviness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The backslider in heart shall be filled with his own ways: and a good man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be satisfied",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The simple believeth every word: but the prudent man looketh well to his going.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " feareth, and departeth from evil: but the fool rageth, and is confident.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " soon angry dealeth foolishly: and a man of wicked devices is hated.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The simple inherit folly: but the prudent are crowned with knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The evil bow before the good; and the wicked at the gates of the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The poor is hated even by his own neighbor: but the rich ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " many friends.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that despiseth his neighbor sinneth: but he that hath mercy on the poor, happy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do they not err that devise evil? but mercy and truth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to them that devise good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In all labor there is profit: but the talk of the lips ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only to penury.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The crown of the wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their riches: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the foolishness of fools ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A true witness delivereth souls: but a deceitful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "witness",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speaketh lies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the fear of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strong confidence: and his children shall have a place of refuge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the multitude of people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the king's honor: but in the want of people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the destruction of the prince.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " slow to wrath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of great understanding: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hasty of spirit exalteth folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A sound heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the life of the flesh: but envy the rottenness of the bones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that oppresseth the poor reproacheth his Maker: but he that honoreth him hath mercy on the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked is driven away in his wickedness: but the righteous hath hope in his death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom resteth in the heart of him that hath understanding: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that which is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the midst of fools is made known.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Righteousness exalteth a nation: but sin ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a reproach to any people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.14.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.14.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king's favor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " towards a wise servant: but his wrath is ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " him that causeth shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
